{"5123900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pack a Plush!", "steam_appid": 5123900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pack a Plush!</strong> is a cozy collecting and organizing game where every batch brings something new to discover. Pick up adorable plushies, arrange them into satisfying displays, and create valuable combinations to build your collection. Hunt for legendary plushies, fulfill requests, and turn your growing collection into rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy &amp; Organize</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy batches of adorable plushies and see what you get. Pick them up, move them around, and arrange them into displays to start building your collections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123900/extras/8a4406fb4b9e48b3a24eb9b8aac50816.poster.avif?t=1788359999\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123900/extras/8a4406fb4b9e48b3a24eb9b8aac50816.webm?t=1788359999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123900/extras/8a4406fb4b9e48b3a24eb9b8aac50816.mp4?t=1788359999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect &amp; Discover</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new plushies, rare variants, and different ways to combine them. Build pairs, triples, quads, rows, columns, and complete sets to earn collection multipliers and boost your package profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123900/extras/eb39ff6b7289401d33be9da00d4b1ac6.poster.avif?t=1788359999\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123900/extras/eb39ff6b7289401d33be9da00d4b1ac6.webm?t=1788359999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123900/extras/eb39ff6b7289401d33be9da00d4b1ac6.mp4?t=1788359999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cash Out &amp; Collect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cash out your completed collections for profit. Watch your earnings grow as you find better combinations, then use your profits to buy more batches and chase bigger and rarer collections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123900/extras/2ca2576445d45d0efb6d0af52ab8bf6b.poster.avif?t=1788359999\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123900/extras/2ca2576445d45d0efb6d0af52ab8bf6b.webm?t=1788359999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123900/extras/2ca2576445d45d0efb6d0af52ab8bf6b.mp4?t=1788359999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decorate Your Space</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your collection space your own cozy plushie paradise. Unlock new decorations and arrange your displays however you like, creating a space filled with the plushies you've discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123900/extras/e2eb539614ff724dfc00e2c3d46f06e9.poster.avif?t=1788359999\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123900/extras/e2eb539614ff724dfc00e2c3d46f06e9.webm?t=1788359999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123900/extras/e2eb539614ff724dfc00e2c3d46f06e9.mp4?t=1788359999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧸 Buy batches of adorable plushies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗄️ Pick up, organize, and arrange plushies into displays.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ Discover rare variants and valuable combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 Complete collections and cash them out for profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 Build pairs, triples, quads, rows, columns, full sets and more! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⬆️ Earn collection multipliers and unlock upgrades as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✏️ Unlock decorations and customize your collection space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 Keep collecting, organizing, and discovering new plushies.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pack a Plush!</strong> is a cozy collecting and organizing game where every batch brings something new to discover. Pick up adorable plushies, arrange them into satisfying displays, and create valuable combinations to build your collection. Hunt for legendary plushies, fulfill requests, and turn your growing collection into rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy &amp; Organize</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy batches of adorable plushies and see what you get. Pick them up, move them around, and arrange them into displays to start building your collections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123900/extras/8a4406fb4b9e48b3a24eb9b8aac50816.poster.avif?t=1788359999\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123900/extras/8a4406fb4b9e48b3a24eb9b8aac50816.webm?t=1788359999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123900/extras/8a4406fb4b9e48b3a24eb9b8aac50816.mp4?t=1788359999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect &amp; Discover</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new plushies, rare variants, and different ways to combine them. Build pairs, triples, quads, rows, columns, and complete sets to earn collection multipliers and boost your package profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123900/extras/eb39ff6b7289401d33be9da00d4b1ac6.poster.avif?t=1788359999\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123900/extras/eb39ff6b7289401d33be9da00d4b1ac6.webm?t=1788359999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123900/extras/eb39ff6b7289401d33be9da00d4b1ac6.mp4?t=1788359999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cash Out &amp; Collect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cash out your completed collections for profit. Watch your earnings grow as you find better combinations, then use your profits to buy more batches and chase bigger and rarer collections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123900/extras/2ca2576445d45d0efb6d0af52ab8bf6b.poster.avif?t=1788359999\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123900/extras/2ca2576445d45d0efb6d0af52ab8bf6b.webm?t=1788359999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123900/extras/2ca2576445d45d0efb6d0af52ab8bf6b.mp4?t=1788359999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decorate Your Space</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your collection space your own cozy plushie paradise. Unlock new decorations and arrange your displays however you like, creating a space filled with the plushies you've discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123900/extras/e2eb539614ff724dfc00e2c3d46f06e9.poster.avif?t=1788359999\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123900/extras/e2eb539614ff724dfc00e2c3d46f06e9.webm?t=1788359999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5123900/extras/e2eb539614ff724dfc00e2c3d46f06e9.mp4?t=1788359999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧸 Buy batches of adorable plushies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗄️ Pick up, organize, and arrange plushies into displays.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ Discover rare variants and valuable combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 Complete collections and cash them out for profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 Build pairs, triples, quads, rows, columns, full sets and more! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⬆️ Earn collection multipliers and unlock upgrades as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✏️ Unlock decorations and customize your collection space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 Keep collecting, organizing, and discovering new plushies.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Pack a Plush! is a cozy collection game where you buy batches of adorable plushies, organize them into disp